# Alesha's Legacy: "gains deathtouch and indestructible until end of turn". Turn 3: Bot1's Memnite attacks and Bot2's Hill Giant
# (3/3) blocks it. The Legacy cast after blockers gives the Memnite deathtouch and indestructible: it deals 1 to the Giant, which
# dies, and the Hill Giant's 3 damage does not destroy the Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Alesha's Legacy
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Hill Giant
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
